@startuml
title State Diagram - Order Class Lifecycle

' Aceasta diagrama descrie starile clasei "Order" pe baza enum-ului "OrderStatus".
' (Conform precizarilor din rubrica pentru diagrama de stare).

[*] --> CREATED : Order placed successfully

state CREATED {
  CREATED : entry / Initialize total and items
  CREATED : do / Wait for payment
}

CREATED --> PAID : User processes payment successfully (OrderService.pay)
CREATED --> CANCELLED : Payment failed / User cancels

state PAID {
  PAID : entry / Set paidAt timestamp
  PAID : do / Wait for restaurant preparation and delivery
}

PAID --> DELIVERED : Order physically delivered (OrderService.markAsDelivered)

state DELIVERED {
  DELIVERED : entry / Set deliveredAt timestamp
}

DELIVERED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

@enduml
